@model AIS.Models.ExecutiveDashboardPageModel
<section class="regional-command" aria-label="Dark Regional Audit Pulse dashboard">
    <div class="regional-section-label"><h3>Regional risk overview</h3>
        <span>Open paras · high-risk exposure · aging days · compliance cycles</span></div>
    <partial name="_Sections" model="Model" />
    @if (Model.RoleOracleEnabled)
    {
        <partial name="_RoleReporting" model="Model" />
    }
    else
    {
        <div class="regional-section-label"><h3>Branch Risk Heatmap</h3>
            <span>Up to six authorized branches per batch</span></div>
        <partial name="_EntityComparison" model="Model" />
    }
    <section class="regional-footer exec-panel">
        <div><span class="regional-eyebrow">PRIORITY MONITORING</span>
            <h3>Observations requiring leadership attention</h3></div>
        <p>The bounded critical list and follow-up data identify high-risk, over-365-day or over-three-cycle paras. Audit end dates are not remediation deadlines. Branch exposure is not a prediction of losses.</p>
    </section>
</section>